---

kind: Data
object: KBArticle
records:
  - Title: How to Reset Your Password
    Body: "Go to Settings > Security > Change Password. Enter your current password and your new password twice. Click Save."
    Category: How-To
    Published: true
  - Title: Troubleshooting Login Issues
    Body: "If you cannot log in: 1) Clear browser cache 2) Try incognito mode 3) Check if Caps Lock is on 4) Contact support if issue persists."
    Category: Troubleshooting
    Published: true
  - Title: What are the system requirements?
    Body: "PAD works in any modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge). No installation required. JavaScript must be enabled."
    Category: FAQ
    Published: true
  - Title: Release Notes v2.5
    Body: "New features: Bulk import, Export to .pady, Record-level security, Role hierarchy. Bug fixes: Layout duplication, Picklist sorting."
    Category: Release Notes
    Published: true
  - Title: How to Import Data
    Body: "Click Import in the top bar. Choose YAML Model tab for schema import or Data tab for CSV/JSON records. Preview before importing."
    Category: How-To
    Published: true
  - Title: Troubleshooting Slow Performance
    Body: "1) Reduce page size in list view 2) Clear embedding cache 3) Close unused browser tabs 4) Try a different browser."
    Category: Troubleshooting
    Published: true
  - Title: How to Configure Apps and Tabs
    Body: "Go to Setup app > Apps. Create a new app, add tabs for each object. Set visibility per profile. Set one app as default."
    Category: How-To
    Published: true
  - Title: Data Model Best Practices
    Body: "Use meaningful API names. Add picklist values before creating records. Set up layouts before going live. Define record types for different workflows."
    Category: FAQ
    Published: false
